   "title": "What to listen for",
   "content": "<p>The Americas' signature is <strong>syncopation inside a duple frame</strong>: the surdo answering on beat 2, semiquavers underneath, and the 3+3+2 <strong>tresillo</strong>. The gold questions use a real 1923 recording of a maxixe — the dance that became samba.</p>"
